{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-31","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：可公度量与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"To find two medial straight lines commensurable in square only, containing a rational rectangle, and such that the square on the greater is greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with the greater.","book":10,"number":31,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.31","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.31/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":31,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","contentId":"euclid-10-31","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e16a9d0290d2aeea206139cf10ef0bf6ec65e271eef79ccd71b0c38dae869b7","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-31.statement","euclid-10-31.construction.1","euclid-10-31.proof.1","euclid-10-31.proof.2","euclid-10-31.construction.2","euclid-10-31.proof.3","euclid-10-31.proof.4","euclid-10-31.proof.5","euclid-10-31.proof.6","euclid-10-31.proof.7","euclid-10-31.proof.8","euclid-10-31.proof.9","euclid-10-31.proof.10","euclid-10-31.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-31.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa38c644ccebfedadec2329b98f86336abcfddd47384a76ef04e2b4150c8647b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find two medial straight lines commensurable in square only, containing a rational rectangle, and such that the square on the greater is greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with the greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"发现两枚中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度, 装有有理 矩形, 数量较大的正方形比数量较小的正方形多, 数量较大的直线长度可公度, 数量小于正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"184c2026006d45c39af027f9194b3568666bda5106c70c4e1b416184e0212a80","citations":["euclid-10-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be set out two rational straight lines A, B commensurable in square only and such that the square on A, being the greater, is greater than the square on B the less by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with A. [[X. 29](/principles/euclid-10-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不妨列出两条有理线段 A,B 平方可公度而长度不可公度,A,即数量较大的正方形,大于B正方形正方形正方形正方形长度可公度A直线长度可公度正方形正方形有理线段有理线段有理线段有理线段有理线段有理线段有理线段正方形正方形正方形正方形有理线段有理线段有理线段有理线段有理线段正方形正方形正方形正方形正方形正方形正方形B有理线段有理线段有理线段正方形正方形正方形正方形 [[X. 29](/principles/euclid-10-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fbccff9dbe5c7614de21276ec076f59b53cedd439202f598b44071a3f287af1a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let the square on C be equal to the rectangle A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C正方形等于矩形、AB"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89e0d87321816bd61b9b942067df9109de488fc1801abece9e3d835b075be0f4","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the rectangle A, B is medial; [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)] therefore the square on C is also medial; therefore C is also medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在矩形 A,B是中项无理线段;因此,C的正方形也是中项无理线段;因此,C也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)] [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f1539b094b098810f3e84178ac89c6d121d2b800551ba62392b511067d266980","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the rectangle C, D be equal to the square on B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C,D等于B正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9202fc86d951116da29dfe5d4bd8ee25e6eb60c420a99115f85bf48293ea961","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the square on B is rational; therefore the rectangle C, D is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在B正方形是有理,因此矩形、CD也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"02bcd4804ac402b938e62e034e534e3138fb36c31f52b80c9529bffb9f6e8766","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as A is to B, so is the rectangle A, B to the square on B, while the square on C is equal to the rectangle A, B, and the rectangle C, D is equal to the square on B, therefore, as A is to B, so is the square on C to the rectangle C, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为 A 与 B 之比等于以 A、B 为边的矩形面积与以 B 为边的正方形面积之比，而以 C 为边的正方形面积等于以 A、B 为边的矩形面积，以 C、D 为边的矩形面积等于以 B 为边的正方形面积，所以 A 与 B 之比等于以 C 为边的正方形面积与以 C、D 为边的矩形面积之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"96b7f87951db98e0cde477f33e9136fcb3c4f174127261780f65efe4939bce4f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the square on C is to the rectangle C, D, so is C to D; therefore also, as A is to B, so is C to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,C的正方形是矩形 C,D,C和D,C和D也是这样;因此,A和B的比等于C和D的比；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35b0a080a315bcec781a3e78931440e1aa00a3dec65efb7b242d36243a6c4e50","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A is commensurable with B in square only; therefore C is also commensurable with D in square only. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A为可公度,正方形为B;因此,C也是可公度,D只为正方形。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0fd14d5604ee29a417670a9598e3aec2c264afd21667430b345e967f0cf96a6d","citations":["euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And C is medial; therefore D is also medial. [[X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23), addition]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C是中项无理线段,D也是中项无理线段,加号 [ [X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b88c6b6572fab3952729e97e43d2cf7d8e6dcb80e3daf6d68285731a228442b0","citations":["euclid-10-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as A is to B, so is C to D, and the square on A is greater than the square on B by the square on a straight line commensurable with A, therefore also the square on C is greater than the square on D by the square on a straight line commensurable with C. [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A对B的比等于C对D的比,A对正方形的比比正方形对B的比高出可公度对A的直线正方形的比,因此,C对正方形的比也高于D对正方形的比,正方形对可公度对C的直线可公度对C的比则高于正方形；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d1560831c9b5f52670dbf89d5911763c293f1d933e5b829bb5ee0b5a2fb9962","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore two medial straight lines C, D, commensurable in square only and containing a rational rectangle, have been found, and the square on C is greater than the square on D by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,已经发现2,中项无理线段,C,D,平方可公度而长度不可公度,有理,矩形,C,正方形,D,正方形,C直线长度可公度,C,比正方形,正方形以上。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"483712ba0866d36ba9d339c14a5e26385aea1e0cfe1aaf485e801a612e976cc8","citations":["euclid-10-30"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly also it can be proved that the square on C exceeds the square on D by the square on a straight line incommensurable with C, when the square on A is greater than the square on B by the square on a straight line incommensurable with A. [[X. 30](/principles/euclid-10-30)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,C比正方形比D比正方形比不可公度比C比正方形,A比正方形比正方形比A比正方形比正方形比不可公度比A比比正方形比正方形比正方形比不可公度比A。（相关点与线段：B） [[X. 30](/principles/euclid-10-30)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-31.source","contentId":"euclid-10-31","revisionId":"euclid-10-31@raw-0e16a9d0290d2aee","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d37626cc451570539c34f0eb23308beb0bae4708a822994fcd4dcc3ca2092937","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.31/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.31\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/